WEBVTT

1
00:00:09.274 --> 00:00:13.889
<v><b>Presenter:</b></v> Good evening. Welcome to <i>Quiz Night</i>.

2
00:00:14.026 --> 00:00:16.747
Tonight’s show comes from Manchester.

3
00:00:18.882 --> 00:00:23.071
And our first contestant is Eddie from Manchester.

4
00:00:23.094 --> 00:00:26.699
Hi, Eddie. Are you nervous?

5
00:00:26.733 --> 00:00:31.164
<v><b>Eddie:</b></v> No, not really. I think I’m, er, well prepared.

6
00:00:31.187 --> 00:00:36.375
<v><b>Presenter:</b></v> Well, let’s hope so. The rules are the same as always.

7
00:00:36.490 --> 00:00:42.573
I’m going to read you some sentences, and you have ten seconds to say

8
00:00:42.585 --> 00:00:46.108
if the sentence is true or false.

9
00:00:46.338 --> 00:00:51.308
If you get the first answer right, you win one hundred pounds.

10
00:00:51.446 --> 00:00:59.549
Then for each correct answer, you double your money, so if you get the second answer right,

11
00:00:59.630 --> 00:01:07.286
you win two hundred pounds, and for the third correct answer, you win four hundred pounds.

12
00:01:07.573 --> 00:01:14.035
For eight correct answers, you win twelve thousand eight hundred pounds.

13
00:01:17.295 --> 00:01:22.609
But if you get an answer wrong, you lose all the money.

14
00:01:24.905 --> 00:01:31.631
Remember, you can also phone a friend, so if you’re not sure about one of the answers,

15
00:01:31.735 --> 00:01:34.283
you can phone your friend to help you.

16
00:01:34.593 --> 00:01:35.936
Is that OK, Eddie?

17
00:01:35.953 --> 00:01:37.388
<v><b>Eddie:</b></v> Yeah, OK.